! Game text
| Use 2 Force to deploy on a Rebel or alien. Immune to attrition &lt; 5. Also, when present at the start of a battle, may use 1 Force to cause one opponent's character of ability = 1 (your choice) to move away (for free), or that character is immediately lost. || Use 2 Force to deploy on {{Errata hl|your}} Rebel or alien. {{Errata hl|Character is}} immune to attrition &lt; 5. Also, {{Errata hl|When a battle was just initiated where present}}, may use 1 Force to {{Errata hl|choose}} one opponent's character of ability = 1 {{Errata hl|present}} to move away (for free), or that character is {{Errata hl|lost}}.
